<title>UK: MFI profits up 63 percent in first half.</title>
<headline>MFI profits up 63 percent in first half.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks to November 9</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.85		   vs 2.37</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.70		   vs 1.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     32.7		   vs 20.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   440.5		  vs 380.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 29.0 and 40.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - MFI Furniture Group Plc</p>
